SUMMARY:Fine-Tune Your First Open Source Model in 30 Minutes: A Live Walkt
 hrough
DESCRIPTION:All Things Open RTP Meetup\nSave the date now for our in-perso
 n September meetup!\n\nThe topic is wildly interesting and sure to educate
  and entertain - **"Fine-Tune Your First Open Source Model in 30 Minutes: 
 A Live Walkthrough"**.\n\nAlso\, we plan to add a second speaker soon - be
  on the lookout. This is the final meetup before All Things Open 2026. We 
 want it to be special and deliver a ton of value.\n\nDoors open at 6:00 pm
  for networking\, food and beverages\, and tons of (free) swag. Live progr
 amming begins at 6:30 sharp.\n\n**This meetup is sponsored and made possib
 le by the team at [Randstad Digital powered by Torc](https://www.torc.dev/
 community-ato?utm_source=atonewsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=atopa
 rtnership).** Randstad Digital powered by Torc is a global community for t
 echnology professionals looking to grow their careers\, meet good people\,
  build new skills\, and stay connected to opportunities along the way.\n\n
 * [Check out the website here](https://www.torc.dev/community-ato?utm_sour
 ce=atonewsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=atopartnership)\n* [Discord
 ](http://torc.dev/discord)\n* [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/company/
 torcdotdev/)\n* Social handle (all platforms) - @torcdotdev\n* Community E
 mail - [[community@torc.dev](mailto:community@torc.dev)]([mailto:community
 @torc.dev](http://mailto:community@torc.dev/) "[mailto:community@torc.dev]
 (http://mailto:community@torc.dev/)")\n* Primary contact - Taylor\, VP of 
 Global Community\n* Additional team contact - Briana\, Head of Global Oper
 ations\n\n**Date:** Tuesday evening\, September 8\n\n**Speaker:** Nihal Ka
 ul\, Lead Software Engineer\, Revscale AI\n\n**Topic:** Fine-Tune Your Fir
 st Open Source Model in 30 Minutes: A Live Walkthrough\n\n**Abstract:**\nT
 his 30-45 talk walks through fine tuning a small open source model on a re
 al dataset\, live on stage\, using a free Google Colab GPU. The audience s
 ees the full workflow from dataset prep through training to a working fine
 -tuned model. The best part.. Nihal shares the notebook with attendees so 
 they can run it themselves after the session.\n\n**Venue Location & Direct
 ions:**\nLocation: Fidelity Investments\, Durham\, NC\n[[https://goo.gl/ma
 ps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6](https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6)]([https://goo
 .gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6](https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6))\nIf yo
 u enter “Select Dr\, Durham\, NC” into your navigation it will take yo
 u to the parking lot access road and then just follow the signs to Visitor
  parking and then to the building we will be meeting in. Once you have arr
 ived at the Guest Parking area\, proceed to the large building on the left
 .\n\n**Parking:** [[https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6](https://goo.gl/
 maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6)]([https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6](https://g
 oo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6))\n\n**Registration and Government ID Require
 d**\nPlease note\, security protocols onsite require everyone attending to
  register ahead of time using your first and last name as it appears on yo
 ur government ID. **\\*Note\, by RSVP'ing for this meetup on [[Meetup.com]
 (http://meetup.com/)]([http://meetup.com/](http://meetup.com/)) you are "r
 egistering" for the event.**\n\n**You'll need to bring that ID with you to
  the event.**\nUpon entry you will be directed to a table where your id wi
 ll be checked and you will be given your pre-registered nametag and you wi
 ll be escorted into the event space. This will help speed you through the 
 lobby and get you to the food\, swag\, and content without delay.\n\n**Que
 stions?** Contact us at [info@allthingsopen.org.](http://info@allthingsope
 n.org./)\n\n**RSVP required**\n\\*This is a free event. However\, an RSVP 
 is required. Seating is limited\, so RSVP's will be capped as we fill up. 
 Please move quickly and RSVP to save your spot if interested. When you RSV
 P you will be added to our mailing list to receive future event updates. Y
 ou can unsubscribe at any time.
